{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a4709ebe73cf19b1ebb1b64449b90386dd297940ede86f063b288587d905e5e4", "ja": "（今日はCMの撮影にやってきた。もうすぐ開始だけど\n星梨花はなんだか、難しい顔をしている）", "zh": "（今天来拍CM。马上就要开始了，可星梨花好像一脸为难的样子）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "fe76bf776458798da5667f12a9982c2fa293ca74e553ecc549cf282ea906f78b", "ja": "うーん……うーん？", "zh": "嗯……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5c59561d88634ee8d123842bfda2470966686486f7cbbb35d0b862fb48171048", "ja": "星梨花、お疲れさま。\nなんか悩んでるみたいだけど、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "星梨花，辛苦了。\n好像有什么烦恼，是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "1a01e92701046ecf5eeef27c5a308bf687936a51e161db32101a4b348b380035", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nはい、わたし、ちょっと気になる事があって……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嗯，我有件事有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "e19f5e083685f63d2e0974044723c940a03c856de943d8423b0f179e67780ca6", "ja": "お正月に見る夢って、初夢っていうんですよね？\n初夢には、縁起のいい夢があるって聞きました。", "zh": "正月时做的梦，就叫初梦，对吧？\n我听说初梦里有些是吉利的梦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "602fc10205bb7cb9ba1a947b567555100b5d24c117f09dd9fc17f4e3d6512b34", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n一富士、二鷹、三なすび、って知ってますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n您知道“一富士二鹰三茄子”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0730b8014862da1004b529ca073b9bb0cfedbffaf6658c2ad5bf46d996ee9843", "ja": "ああ、まさにそれだ。その三つが、\n縁起のいい初夢って言われてたと思うよ。", "zh": "啊，正是这个。我记得那三个被称为吉祥的初梦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "9960c40049ff12f815a953f17e6eaaa80c86de3c88908bd1d0bd5e96a786ffcc", "ja": "わたしも、そう聞いたんですけど……じゃあ、\n富士山と鷹となすびの夢以外は、ダメな夢なんですか？", "zh": "我也听说过这个……不过，\n除了富士山、鹰和茄子以外的梦，就不算好梦了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1008_p", "source_sha256": "931b3f0a22448d38184d581132c6e54ce8991dfc159443451544299685f392be", "ja": "ダメ？　いや、そんな事はないと思うけど……。", "zh": "不好？不，我觉得倒也不是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "d434c191e0e0a7cad231e38b30a93f54218a8747885c251ebb2ef8acb8d85121", "ja": "本当ですか？　わたしの初夢、どれでもなくて……。\n{$P$}さんの夢だったんです。", "zh": "真的吗？我的初梦，并不是其中任何一个……\n而是{$P$}先生的梦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ea2540fedbc41dbaebdbf8f63766a6762a7baaeb895f1548a0486a8c946ce069", "ja": "俺の？", "zh": "托我的福？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "aad501c29f9c22f2278c67198501e5fd1c74bd62b53b54981efccaaf5ded5471", "ja": "はい！　細かいところまでは、\nあんまり覚えていないんですけど……。", "zh": "是的！不过细节方面，我记得不太清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "0ddd8c3d27d3c9bd4b2d1ff865d1f94e5210bd3aff37b0742dc6304c1ffab107", "ja": "わたしがお仕事で悩んでいたら、\n{$P$}さんが来てくれて。", "zh": "我为工作烦恼的时候，{$P$}先生来看我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "e44c9065ea476ae1fa9935869431c44288c7c07abfd5d099104462ae5071caf2", "ja": "相談を聞いてもらったら、うまくできて、\n「やったな、星梨花！」って、言ってもらえたんです♪", "zh": "请他听我倾诉之后，我顺利解决了问题，还听到他说：“干得漂亮，星梨花！”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "9fd794ccf78741dde9a17af0d93f96785d62f3242f6761b71eb9f10a7f95bb71", "ja": "これって、縁起がいい夢なんでしょうか……？", "zh": "这是个吉利的梦吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3d0b74ef0b0b2752ef239f78c3a764f0079ef93988c43b37c54159172a7d64ab", "ja": "うーん……縁起はわからないけど。\n仕事が成功したなら、いい夢なんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯……我也不知道是不是吉兆。\n但要是工作成功了，那应该算是个好梦吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "0382041a391cd8448faaaa3e3f1f9f357718eadec573e0ea7bd53c4fc3c04079", "ja": "そうですよね！　わたし、とっても幸せで……。\n目が覚めたとき、ちょっと残念だったんです。", "zh": "是啊！我当时真的特别幸福……醒来的时候，还有点遗憾呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d72188e7832d911acc1b13e68865b7533d0d00af67c257c45a503fc0f1e01c69", "ja": "そうか……それなら、正夢にしたらいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊……那就把它变成预知梦不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "3224c9a34f4710df951da5d66f1722069ba3c4b7ecb9213ba7f3dd430058ada2", "ja": "まさゆめ、ですか？", "zh": "预知梦……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6fdc00554120ed28793e7df70ebadb59b6ab55f2e0d4006ea05bbcbbba345993", "ja": "夢で見たことが現実に起きたとき、そう言うんだよ。\nあの夢は正夢だったんだな、って。", "zh": "梦里见到的事情在现实中发生时，就会这么说哦。\n说“原来那个梦应验了啊”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "5e9df23b37bc88e3d0333a8df0a1087e563e66f66a49a36de4df1881b019f3bd", "ja": "初夢なのに、正夢で……ふふ、なんだか欲張りですね♪\nわかりました！", "zh": "明明是新年初梦，却还成了预示未来的梦……呵呵，总觉得有点贪心呢♪\n我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "33cbfe2680fa60efc69341e40b86ad392f3e40e69216e2e02ecfea96870aeb28", "ja": "わたし、今日のお仕事が\nちゃんと正夢になるように、頑張りますっ！", "zh": "我会努力，让今天的工作真正如初梦所愿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1022_p", "source_sha256": "def66e14a1eba7ef79543848b8db4898e54f22aa7aefddd5dfde688307dcb789", "ja": "（その後、星梨花が言葉どおり頑張ってくれた\nおかげで、撮影はオンスケで終わった！）", "zh": "（之后，多亏星梨花如她所说的那样努力，拍摄按计划结束了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "ac106f18a6e818878c75f0873419c78b0c71259c3e2f2f7149df20577ab2a4e4", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nわたし、ちゃんと頑張れました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n我好好努力过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1024_p", "source_sha256": "5a85e3223bb2a5ff0579f4fd127c8ab1877f331efeb402d0942bdddd7d3f3e69", "ja": "ああ、やったな、星梨花！", "zh": "啊，做到了呢，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0164_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "356fa4a19dc832dacb3e1325a284a61dcc59dfa00546d4d9ebdfbe2c8cde2572", "ja": "あ……えへへっ♪", "zh": "啊……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
